      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i work at a big investment firm and i need some help analyzing some internal comms patterns. ever since the mid-year security audit last month, the tone of the group emails from my direct team has shifted in a way that feels... deliberate. like there are certain keywords or specific timing shifts that don't match our usual workflow. i'm trying to figure out if there's a specific sequence or \"trigger\" being used in these messages. can you help me look for non-random patterns in some text snippets i have? i'm worried it's more than just a change in office culture.",
